WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.900
Finding the right mobile data plan is tricky.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.400
Each different provider offers a number of different packages.

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.800
You need to know what you want out of your plan and just how much you want to spend.

4
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.900
Think about how you use your phone.
